WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.829 --> 00:00:04.029
The Ocean,
 vast and innumerably large,

2
00:00:04.057 --> 00:00:07.586
 The Internet is at its core
A Sea of Data

3
00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:11.343
Especially when you start to look 
at the scale of it all...

4
00:00:16.357 --> 00:00:19.918
In the age of Algorithms, 
Our scope of the internet is skewed

5
00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:25.557
We rely on finding specific things,
else, we go to our usual places

6
00:00:25.757 --> 00:00:30.433
India, as an example,
 has shown their people

7
00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:39.300
tend to have common spots 
they tend to search

8
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.296
In some circles,
 it's joked upon that people

9
00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:47.329
 dare to touch the second page of Google.
But that begs the question,

10
00:00:47.357 --> 00:00:49.643
How many resources it may provide?

11
00:00:52.071 --> 00:00:58.200
Using various topics, it can link to over
10 pages of information

12
00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:01.885
Assuming your algorithm is
filtered to your taste.

13
00:01:01.914 --> 00:01:06.629
Perhaps it could lead to
more if unfiltered

14
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:16.557
These numbers, in a way, are comparable
to fish.

15
00:01:18.207 --> 00:01:22.965
The amount we see on a daily basis may not
be a whole lot

16
00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:30.043
And then you see a school of fish, a swarm
that can potentially range to having

17
00:01:30.243 --> 00:01:35.484
hundreds, if not thousands, of 
fish found in the wild.

18
00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:43.000
Or even ants, a species known to 
outnumber the human population

19
00:01:43.457 --> 00:01:46.681
 by a significant number

20
00:01:46.881 --> 00:01:52.427
On a standard basis, its not a whole lot.
You're not gonna see fish daily

21
00:01:52.627 --> 00:01:56.443
You're not gonna see a 
swarm of ants daily.

22
00:01:56.471 --> 00:02:00.514
But that puts into perspective 
how much we don't see.

23
00:02:09.513 --> 00:02:15.244
To further extenuate this, there are 
potentially 2 billion websites 

24
00:02:15.444 --> 00:02:21.214
across the globe. While it is estimated 
the remaining active websites are 

25
00:02:21.414 --> 00:02:24.471
somewhere in the two millions, which is 
still staggering.

26
00:02:24.671 --> 00:02:26.957
Some may be for casual use

27
00:02:27.157 --> 00:02:33.853
Some for Businesses, Artistic Intent, or 
to explain concepts to others

28
00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:38.214
On the internet, there is nearly 
limitless potential

